      500.24,
      286.46,
      612.53
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired: Allotment of land called in extent 2.5962 of Hectare shown as lot 1823 in FVP 29 dated 25.05.2016 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in with in the Pradeshiya Sabha limits of Trincomalee No. 244N Abayapura Grama Niladhari Division, Divisional Secretariat Division of Town and Gravets, Trincomalee District and bounded as follows. Details Attached.",
